[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD002
TITLE: Runway designation selection cases
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall attempt a landing on a departure-only runway, a takeoff on an arrival-only runway, an assignment to a closed runway, and a dual occupancy of two non-independent runways. Each attempt shall be refused. A landing on an empty both-use runway shall be accepted. Acceptance is those five outcomes.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Designation and independence are data, so the test supplies the data and checks the decision.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. Visual separation, LAHSO, radar vectoring, TRACON, enroute control, and wake RECAT are outside this increment.
RELATIONS:
